Subject: Model comparison through hierarchical specification in Stan
Message-ID: <UBR1k0bTJmE.7jVncFPHX4oJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/UBR1k0bTJmE/m/7jVncFPHX4oJ>
