From u2a7f346506a3e9ff at groups.google.com  Fri Dec 13 18:09:09 2013
From: u2a7f346506a3e9ff at groups.google.com (Marcus Brubaker)
Date: Fri, 13 Dec 2013 18:09:09 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] speeding up a space-time model?
Message-ID: <EPY01mNCgrg.hrUTKQHARQMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
