Hi!

I was wondering if a function is somewhere available in rstan which formats the output from a stanfit object into the same data structure as returned from the R2WinBUGS bugs function?

I.e. something similar to the R2jags package which does provide for a jags-fit object a jagsfit$BUGSoutput entry in its output.

A function like this would be extremely handy in order to use Stan as a drop-in replacement in programs which have been written with WinBUGS in mind.

Anything like this already available or planned? I would love to replace WinBUGS in a lot of places.

Best,
Sebastian

