That's indeed a bug.  Thanks for the report.  I'll look
into trying to fix the underlying issue, which is that it's
trying to parse an expression, which can be a number,
and the parser's peeling the "inf" off the front as a number.
That's why you see the error at the location you do.

I amended our issue to make sure we fix the issue you bring up:

   https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/issues/239

- Bob

