Subject: Another question about fitting linear mixed models
Message-ID: <Vshwykvdgno.d72waA3avMoJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/Vshwykvdgno/m/d72waA3avMoJ>
